{"speciesId":377,"names":{"fr":"Regirock","es":"Regirock","en":"Regirock","ja":"レジロック"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"REGIROCK was sealed away by people long ago. If this POKéMON’s body is damaged in battle, it is said to seek out suitable rocks on its own to repair itself."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"REGIROCK’s body is composed entirely of rocks. Recently, a study made the startling discovery that the rocks were all unearthed from different locations."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A POKéMON that is made entirely of rocks and boulders. If parts of its body chip off in battle, REGIROCK repairs itself by adding new rocks."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is entirely composed of rocks with no sign of a brain or heart. It is a mystery even to modern scientists."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is entirely composed of rocks with no sign of a brain or heart. It is a mystery even to modern scientists."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"The same rocks that form its body have been found in ground layers around the world."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The same rocks that form its body have been found in ground layers around the world."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Tout son corps est fait de roche. S’il s’ébrèche au combat, il utilise des pierres pour le réparer."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Tout son corps est fait de roche. S’il s’ébrèche au combat, il utilise des pierres pour le réparer."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Tout son corps est fait de roche. S’il s’ébrèche au combat, il utilise des pierres pour le réparer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su cuerpo está hecho de roca. Si se astilla durante el combate, emplea piedras para repararlo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"全身が 岩で できている。 戦いで 体が 欠けても 岩を くっつけて 治してしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Les roches qui composent son corps se retrouvent également dans les diverses couches terrestres."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Las rocas que componen el cuerpo de Regirock pueden encontrarse en todos los estratos geológicos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The same rocks that form its body have been found in ground layers around the world."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体を 作っている 岩石と 同じ 物が 世界中の あらゆる 地層で 見つかっている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Regirock fut isolé par les gens il y a très longtemps. Lorsque le corps de ce Pokémon est endommagé au combat, on raconte qu’il cherche des rochers pour se réparer."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A Regirock lo mantuvieron encerrado y aislado hace tiempo. Dicen que, si resulta dañado en combate, se pone él mismo a buscar piedras parecidas a las suyas y se las pone para recomponerse."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Regirock was sealed away by people long ago. If this Pokémon’s body is damaged in battle, it is said to seek out suitable rocks on its own to repair itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"昔 人に 封印された ポケモン。 戦いで 体が 崩れると 自分で 新しい 岩を 探して 直すと いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Le corps de Regirock est entièrement constitué de rochers. Récemment, une étude a découvert que ces rochers provenaient de lieux très variés."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Regirock está formado en su totalidad por piedras. En un estudio reciente, se descubrió que cada una de las piedras había sido desenterrada en sitios distintos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Regirock’s body is composed entirely of rocks. Recently, a study made the startling discovery that the rocks were all unearthed from different locations."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体を つくっている 岩石は すべて 違う 土地から 掘り出された ものであると 最近の 研究で 判明した。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il est entièrement composé de pierre. Si jamais une partie de son corps s’effrite, il la répare en y collant des rochers."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Todo su cuerpo está hecho de roca. Si alguna parte se erosiona, la recompone con más rocas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Every bit of Regirock’s body is made of stone. As parts of its body erode, this Pokémon sticks rocks to itself to repair what’s been lost."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"体の あらゆる 部分が 岩で できている。 体が 削れても 自分で 岩を つけて 治す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Bien que son corps de pierre ait été examiné avec les technologies les plus modernes, nulle trace de cerveau ou de cœur n’a été trouvée."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su cuerpo rocoso ha sido examinado con las técnicas científicas más avanzadas, pero no se han encontrado ni su cerebro ni su corazón."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Cutting-edge technology was used to study the internals of this Pokémon’s rock body, but nothing was found—not even a brain or a heart."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"最新の 科学技術を 使い 岩の 体を 調べたが 脳や 心臓を 見つけられなかった。"}],"varieties":[{"id":377,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"stomp","learns":[[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",18],[23,"level-up",18],[25,"level-up",18]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[5,"level-up",65],[5,"machine",0],[6,"level-up",65],[6,"machine",0],[7,"level-up",65],[7,"machine",0],[8,"level-up",89],[8,"machine",0],[9,"level-up",89],[9,"machine",0],[10,"level-up",89],[10,"machine",0],[11,"level-up",89],[11,"machine",0],[12,"level-up",65],[12,"machine",0],[13,"level-up",65],[13,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",89],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",89],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",67],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",67],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",67],[18,"machine